@startuml
title PJ1 Phase 1 — TypeScript CLI SVG editor
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
package "src/cli" {
  [Cli]
  [CommandRegistry\n(command-name mapping)]
  [Tokenizer]
}
package "src/application" {
  [DocumentSession]
  [CommandHistory]
  [Command / EditCommand]
  [Concrete commands]
  interface DocumentStore
}
package "src/domain" {
  [Document]
  [Shape / Group / Leaves]
  [ShapeFactory\n(shape-name mapping)]
  [ValueRules / AffineTransform]
}
package "src/infrastructure" {
  [SvgFileStore]
  [SvgCodec / SvgElement]
}
[Cli] --> [CommandRegistry\n(command-name mapping)]
[Cli] --> [Tokenizer]
[CommandRegistry\n(command-name mapping)] --> [Concrete commands]
[Concrete commands] --> [Command / EditCommand]
[Command / EditCommand] --> [DocumentSession]
[DocumentSession] --> [CommandHistory]
[DocumentSession] --> DocumentStore
[DocumentSession] --> [Document]
[Concrete commands] --> [ShapeFactory\n(shape-name mapping)]
[ShapeFactory\n(shape-name mapping)] --> [Shape / Group / Leaves]
[Document] --> [Shape / Group / Leaves]
[Shape / Group / Leaves] --> [ValueRules / AffineTransform]
[SvgFileStore] ..|> DocumentStore
[SvgFileStore] --> [SvgCodec / SvgElement]
[SvgCodec / SvgElement] --> [Document]
[SvgCodec / SvgElement] --> [ShapeFactory\n(shape-name mapping)]
note bottom of [CommandRegistry\n(command-name mapping)]
The two name-based mappings are explicit
Phase 2 refactoring points for providers.
end note
@enduml
